<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · keep-host-half-in-vessel · keep-workspace-unbound · keep-workspace-not-a-repo · keep-workspace-detached · keep-tree-unclean · keep-remote-absent · keep-secret-shaped · keep-commit-refused · keep-rebase-refused · keep-push-refused · keep-pushed-differs · keep-lei-unseen

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.house.keeps workspace/keep]] ~ no workspace and no if-due, or a malformed face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-host-half-in-vessel` params=`~ the host half runs on the host, never inside the vessel`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-workspace-unbound` params=`~ the workspace binds no directory`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-workspace-not-a-repo` params=`~ the workspace holds no git repo`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-workspace-detached` params=`~ the workspace stands on a detached head`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-tree-unclean` params=`~ the workspace tree holds unkept changes`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-remote-absent` params=`~ the workspace names no remote`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-secret-shaped` params=`~ the bundle holds secret-shaped strings`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-commit-refused` params=`~ git refused the commit`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-rebase-refused` params=`~ git refused the rebase`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-push-refused` params=`~ git refused the push`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-pushed-differs` params=`~ the pushed tree holds another bundle`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-lei-unseen` params=`~ no keep lei stands strung for the workspace`>>
```

